 Optional properties:
+- nvidia,darcy-axi-config-window: Empty boolean, private Darcy A04 opt-in for
+  the stock fixed-FPCI/dynamic-AXI configuration window. Only valid when the
+  root compatible includes "nvidia,p2894-0050-a04", this controller is
+  "nvidia,tegra210-pcie", and the "cs" resource is exactly 0x11fff000/0x1000.
+  Does not change link/PHY/MSI or BAR1-5 policy. No implicit aperture fallback.
 - pinctrl-names: A list of pinctrl state names. Must contain the following
   entries:
   - "default": active state, puts PCIe I/O out of deep power down state
